"сами по себе не становятся параметрами запроса."
msgstr "With ``authType: signature``, the signature is passed in a request parameter and verified according to ``signatureConfig``. Parameters can be passed in the query string or an ``application/x-www-form-urlencoded`` form. JSON body fields do not automatically become request parameters."

